  (text "Each tilt coil is in series with the NC contact of the other relay.\nThe off state puts both motor leads on 0 V.\nDo not command both tilt directions.\nDo not command both lift directions.\nThe actuator current is not on a nameplate. Power section is TBC.\nConfirm that both leads may sit on 0 V.\nConfirm that Finder .4000 has no internal diode. D2 and D3 stay fitted.\nLimit names inside the actuator are TODO.\nThe lift limits are on sheet 05. The H-bridge is VC-LT-9110.\nLift cable section is TBC.\n001_0V also on sheet 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9.\n211_24C also on sheet 2, 3, 5, 6, 8, 9.\n470_TILT_V also on sheet 6.\n471_TILT_F also on sheet 6.\n490_EXT also on sheet 6.\n491_RET also on sheet 6.\n492_TILTV also on sheet 6.\n493_TILTF also on sheet 6." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 317.50 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "070274a5-a4a7-5a34-8369-7ef4656c7d03"))
